No checks for artifact weapon here...

> - If I zap a pile of 200 C-Rations, will it become 200 of
>   some other food, or will it turn into one of some food?

Random chance of turning into 200 of some other food, or a smaller
number of C-Rations (You feel shuddering vibrations).

> - Do monsters generated by Ki-Rin and suchlike count towards
>   the exctinction count?

Yes and no.  The monster generation counter is incremented, but
monsters created by the monster spell summon nasty ignores monster
extinction.  Once you hit 120 of a monster, they won't randomly be
generated any more, but they can still be created via monster
summoning spells.

