Never bothered trying... not sure...

> - I'm told that some loot that ends up on the dead beasty 
>   does not come from its original inventory, but is generated.
>   How are the chances of that generating a /oWishing? (slim, 
>   no doubt).

You are correct (as experience with a probing attack from Magicbane,
which promptly killed the monster... found additional items).  Wands
are 4% of all randomly-generated items in the main dungeon, 6% in
containers, 5% on the Rogue level, and 8% in hell.  /oWish are .5% of
all wands randomly generated.  Thus, in the normal dungeon, /oWish
would be .02% of all randomly generated items for your standard
altar-camping extinctionist-to-be.  (Stats taken from the standard
wand effects spoiler found at
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/wan1-342.txt and other sites).

